{"id": 5304, "name": "Mena / Ouachita National Forest KOA Journey", "read": "2026-10-16", "pages": [{"url": "https://koa.com/states-provinces/arkansas/", "lines": ["| 15% off 7 nights | View full details Apply Apply Stay for 7 days and get a 15% discount! A great incentive to extend that vacation! | 2 Room Cabin Summer Hot Deal | View full details Apply Apply For a limited time get $35 off per night on our 2 room cabin that will sleep 6. Queen bed, full bed and a bunk bed. Mini fridge, Microwave, cable TV, A/C, propane grill included. Everything you need for that family getaway!", "an facility friendly staff | Oct 04, 2026 We really enjoyed our stay! The cabin was clean and cozy. The only reason I didn’t give a ten on the recommendation was due to the price. I thought it was on the pricey side, at $180 a night. | Oct 02, 2026 Linda is a great owner, very helpful and very friendly. It’s like staying with family. Next time we come, we’ll probably rent a cabin as we will be selling our RV. | Read ", "xtended stays. | How Much Does It Cost to RV Park in Arkansas? | The average cost of an RV campsite in Arkansas depends on where you stay and the hookups you want at your campsite. Staying at an RV park could range from $25 to $50 per night. | What Are the Top Attractions in Arkansas? | You and your family will have plenty of things to do while in Arkansas for vacation. Learn history while visiting historic sites and"]}, {"url": "https://koa.com/", "lines": [], "via": "Find a Campground"}, {"url": "https://koa.com/campgrounds/", "lines": [], "via": "All Campgrounds"}, {"url": "https://koa.com/why-koa/", "lines": [], "via": "Camping at KOA"}, {"url": "https://koa.com/koa-journey-campgrounds/", "lines": [], "via": "KOA Journey Campgrounds"}]}
