n our way back home. | Reply | Karen S. says: November 25, 2022 at 12:12 pm N", "ly people. Highly recommend it. | Reply | Mary C. says: November 25, 2022 at 12:14 pm What a cool place! They have numerous ranges for various purposes. All I brought with me on our trip was a couple of handguns, andfor $75 the kids and I had full access to the facility for the afternoon. We even did some night shooting on their lit range after they closed. Fantastic! | If guns aren’t your thing, this is still a nice"]}]}
